                  <provenance type="#i"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_2">Peterborough,
                        Northamptonshire. Benedictine abbey of St Peter, St Paul, and St Andrew.
                        </orgName><p>The chronicle was written by Walter of Whittlesey, monk of the
                        house. Also inscribed 'Iste liber fuit quondam fratris Walteri de Wytelese',
                        'Walterus de Wytillesey' (fol. 1r, s. xiv).</p><p>Inscribed by the
                        Peterborough monk Roger Bird: 'Liber fratris Rogeri Bird ex dono domini
                        Roberti Kirkton abbatis a.d. m ccccc xx testibus fratre Francisco Lecestre
                        et Willelmo Browene' (fol. 229r). Robert Kirkton was abbot, c.
                        1496--1528.</p></provenance>
